{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13215290","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13215290","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1321529001:0":{"text":"メリッサさん、お墓の状態はどうですか？副葬品は残っていましたか？","source_cn":"梅丽莎，墓穴里的情况还好吗？留下的文物多吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06E560C6D1FD9BB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321529002:0":{"text":"いえ……最悪です。お墓は荒らされ、副葬品はすべて奪われています……！","source_cn":"不好……一点也不好！墓穴里的东西都被盗墓贼抢劫一空了……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F675433F2ACC1ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321529003:0":{"text":"お金儲けのために貴重な遺跡を破壊するなんて……本当にあの墓荒らしが憎い！","source_cn":"为了赚钱，居然将珍贵的遗迹破坏成现在这副惨烈的模样……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE8CD1259E068A21","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321529004:0":{"text":"ああ、君の言うとおりだ……","source_cn":"唉，谁说不是呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B4D6F9C25AD30CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321529005:0":{"text":"でも、まったくの無駄足というわけでもなさそうだよ。","source_cn":"所幸这一趟也不算是完全没有收获。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC109A4C4CE135E3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_c